sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Employee
    participant R as React SPA
    participant F as FastAPI chat service
    participant P as PostgreSQL
    participant H as Haiku - rewrite
    participant E as Azure OpenAI embeddings
    participant S as Azure AI Search
    participant G as Claude Sonnet

    U->>R: "How many PTO days carry over?"
    R->>F: POST /api/v1/conversations/{id}/messages
    F->>P: load last 6 turns
    P-->>F: history
    F->>H: condense history + question into standalone query
    H-->>F: "PTO carryover limit Contoso policy"
    F->>E: embed standalone query
    E-->>F: 3072-dim vector
    F->>S: hybrid search - BM25 + vector, k=30,<br/>semantic reranker on
    S-->>F: 30 candidates with rerank scores
    F->>F: threshold filter, dedupe by doc+section,<br/>keep top 6, order best-last

    alt no chunk above score threshold
        F-->>R: stream refusal - "not in the knowledge base"
        F->>P: persist message, refusal reason, 0 citations
    else grounded path
        F->>G: system prompt + delimited context + question
        G-->>F: streamed answer with [C1] [C3] markers
        F-->>R: SSE tokens then citation payload
        F->>F: validate every marker maps to a real chunk
        F->>P: persist message + message_citations + token cost
    end

    U->>R: clicks citation [C1]
    R->>F: GET /api/v1/chunks/{chunk_id}
    F->>P: fetch chunk text, doc title, page, section
    P-->>F: passage
    F-->>R: source panel with highlighted passage
